{
 "title": "Chapter 9: The Bill Comes Due",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 9: The Bill Comes Due",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s10b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember the *problem* from the beginning.",
     "shot": "c9_remember",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b02",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Too much *land*.",
     "shot": "c9_remember",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:land",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b03",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Too *few* people.",
     "shot": "c9_remember",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:few",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b04",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "For centuries, Russia's answer was to *expand*, to put distance between itself and its enemies.",
     "shot": "c9_expand",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:expand",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "When that wasn't enough, it *spent* people.",
     "shot": "c9_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Serfs*.",
     "shot": "c9_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Peasants*.",
     "shot": "c9_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b08",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Prisoners*.",
     "shot": "c9_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b09",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Soldiers*.",
     "shot": "c9_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b10",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Now it is spending the one thing it *can't* easily make more of.",
     "shot": "c9_cradle",
     "date": 2025,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b11",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And the war is doing it *again*.",
     "shot": "c9_cradle",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:again",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b12",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russia's population peaked at about *148.7* million in 1991.",
     "shot": "c9_popline",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:1991",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b13",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Today it is around 146 million, and *falling*.",
     "shot": "c9_popline",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:falling",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b14",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 2024, Russia recorded about *1.22* million births.",
     "shot": "c9_births",
     "date": 2024,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:births",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b15",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The *fewest* since 1999.",
     "shot": "c9_births",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:fewest",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b16",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Early 2025 was even *worse*.",
     "shot": "c9_births",
     "date": 2025
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b17",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russian demographers described some months as the lowest in *two* centuries.",
     "shot": "c9_births",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:centuries",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b18",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The country's fertility rate is around *1.4* children per woman.",
     "shot": "c9_fertility",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:1.4",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b19",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Far below the *2.1* needed to keep a population steady.",
     "shot": "c9_fertility",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:2.1",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b20",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The *gap* left by the 1990s makes it worse.",
     "shot": "c9_pyramid"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b21",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "There are simply *fewer* women of childbearing age now.",
     "shot": "c9_pyramid"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b22",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The war removes young men, by death and by *emigration*.",
     "shot": "c9_leaving",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b23",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Official forecasts suggest the population could fall to somewhere between *130* and 139 million by 2046.",
     "shot": "c9_forecast",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:fall",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b24",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "About what it was in the Russian Empire of *1897*.",
     "shot": "c9_forecast",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:1897",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b25",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Kremlin has *noticed*.",
     "shot": "c9_policy"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b26",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It has promoted *traditional* family values, restricted abortion access,",
     "shot": "c9_policy",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:values",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop",
       "w:abortion",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b27",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and offered *payments* to larger families.",
     "shot": "c9_policy",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:payments",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b28",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So far, the numbers keep *dropping*.",
     "shot": "c9_stopped",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:dropping",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10i01",
     "text": "Remember the numbers I *promised* you at the very start?",
     "shot": "in_receipt10",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10i02",
     "text": "*Here* they are.",
     "shot": "in_receipt10",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Here",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b29",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And reportedly, in 2025, Russia's statistics agency quietly *stopped* publishing some of its monthly demographic figures.",
     "shot": "c9_stopped",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:stopped",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b30",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The emptiness is most visible in the *east*.",
     "shot": "map:fareast",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b31",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russia spent *four* centuries pushing across Siberia to the Pacific.",
     "shot": "map:fareast",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b32",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Today the Far East, rich in *resources* and thin on people,",
     "shot": "map:fareast",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b33",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "keeps *losing* residents to cities in the west.",
     "shot": "map:fareast",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b34",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "There is one way out that the Kremlin has little *appetite* for.",
     "shot": "c9_door"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10b35",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Mass *immigration*.",
     "shot": "c9_door",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:immigration",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}